CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'thisboard->ao_hwrange[CR_RANGE(cmd->chanlist[0]'
#364: FILE: drivers/staging/comedi/drivers/amplc_pci224.c:1019:
+	if ((thisboard->ao_hwrange[CR_RANGE(cmd->chanlist[0])] &
 	     PCI224_DACCON_POLAR_MASK) == PCI224_DACCON_POLAR_UNI) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

